{"id":"dfcd8a7128928cfb","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md","title":"ZFC Model7 Hull Condensation","display":"df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation — ZFC Model7 Hull Condensation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation"],"display":"df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation — ZFC Model7 Hull Condensation","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-mostowski.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation — ZFC Model7 Hull Condensation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b6ec5105268243bd\" href=\"?note=b6ec5105268243bd\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-mostowski.md\">../batch01/58-df-mostowski.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq\\in V\">\\(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}hull\\text{-}condensation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nM\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\trianglelefteq\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Hull},\n\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M)),\n\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M))\\;\n\\exists H,N,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH=\\operatorname{Hull}(X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\n\\langle H,\\in\\cap H^2\\rangle,M,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(H,\\in\\cap H^2,N,\\pi)\n\\land N\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\langle N,M\\rangle\\in\\trianglelefteq\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}hull\\text{-}condensation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nM\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\trianglelefteq\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Hull},\n\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M)),\n\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M))\\;\n\\exists H,N,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH=\\operatorname{Hull}(X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\n\\langle H,\\in\\cap H^2\\rangle,M,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(H,\\in\\cap H^2,N,\\pi)\n\\land N\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\langle N,M\\rangle\\in\\trianglelefteq\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Skolem 包算子、候选模型集与初始段关系均为显式参数；其传递塌缩目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的细结构初始段。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-mostowski.md","status":"resolved","id":"b6ec5105268243bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-mostowski.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}hull\\text{-}condensation}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nM\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\trianglelefteq\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Hull},\n\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M)),\n\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M))\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Univ}(M))\\;\n\\exists H,N,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH=\\operatorname{Hull}(X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\n\\langle H,\\in\\cap H^2\\rangle,M,L)\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(H,\\in\\cap H^2,N,\\pi)\n\\land N\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\langle N,M\\rangle\\in\\trianglelefteq\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1574,"backlinks":[{"id":"758bd0b48babcc74","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (fine-structural hull-condensation predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md]])"},{"id":"9f10a368431d07c8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2781","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md|58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["b6ec5105268243bd","e91c1261e1c2374b","36d7463d215be751"]}